    <briefdescription>
<para>Loader for cross-platform PluginBundle ZIP archives. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_plugin_bundle_loader_1a3b066f81e8fe4221cfcebabd56b5e3ce" kindref="member">loadBundle()</ref> orchestrates the following steps:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Unpack the ZIP archive to a unique temporary directory.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Parse manifest.json.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Verify the Ed25519 signature of manifest.json (skipped when no public key has been configured — development/test mode only).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Select the native library for the running platform (<ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_plugin_bundle_loader_1af166fae7453c82b31fdb31c88b421184" kindref="member">currentPlatform()</ref>). Falls back to the WASM entry if no native library is present.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Delegate the actual binary load to the supplied <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_module_loader" kindref="compound">ModuleLoader</ref> instance.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: An individual <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_plugin_bundle_loader" kindref="compound">PluginBundleLoader</ref> instance is NOT thread-safe. Create one instance per loading thread or serialise access externally. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
